  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "You need to know how to get the best settings on a Minelab metal detectors."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "On The <a href=\"@crawfords-metal-detectors/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Crawfords Minelab Equinox Masterclass</a> you learn from Minelab Experts on all the basics of setting up your Minelab Equinox from new detectorist right through to experienced levels."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "we have Derek Mclennan and sharron mclennan and paul cee on the Minelab Test lanes to help you get the best out of your detector"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Learn how to properly Set the Ground balance, set the iron bias, adjust tones, the correct sensitivity and a whole lot more on the minelab detecting master class."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "A Short Video of what happens on the Equinox masterclass"
  },
